{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-007.md","record_count":13,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s007-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"சத்யசீலர்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வஞ்சகம் வாழ்ந்தது கிடையாது...கொடுமை நிலைத்ததில்லை...இதைக் கேள்! விழா உன் பொருட்டு நடைபெறுகிறது... விழாவுக்கு நீ வந்துதான் தீர வேண்டும்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்பொருட்டு விழா நடைபெறுகிறது. மனப்பூர்வமாகவா? இல்லை... சம்பிரதாயத்திற்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"சத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தவறு மனோகரா! புத்திர வாஞ்சையற்றவரல்ல புருஷோத்தமர்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்களுடைய ஆசை, அந்த வாஞ்சையும் அற்றுவிடக்கூடாதென்று! ஆனால் அப்பா அணு அணுவாக விஷமாக்கப்படுகிறார்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"சத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எப்படியானாலும் சரி, ராஜ குடும்பத்திலே தகராறு இப்படி பிறர் பேசக்கூடாது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உயர்ந்த எண்ணம்! ஆனால் அந்த ஊர் கெடுப்பவளுக்கு உதயமாகியிருக்க வேண்டும்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"சத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா! உன்னுடைய பிறந்தநாள்... அதிலே நீ இல்லையென்றால்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"ராஜப்பிரியன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அரசர் கவலைப்பட மாட்டார்... அந்த ஆனந்தவல்லி, அருகிலே இருக்கும்போது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"சத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்... இருவருமே இளக்காரம் அடிக்கிறீர்கள்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அமைதி கற்பிப்பது விவேகிகளின் பண்புதான்! ஆனால் ஆமைபோல் அடங்கிக் கிடப்பது வீரர்களின் பண்பல்ல! அந்த மயக்கு மொழிக்காரியும் வருவாள்; அங்கே என் மாதாவும் வரவேண்டும், முடியாது! என்னால் அதைக் காண முடியாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"பத்மாவதி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மனோகரா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"மனோ","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":12,"printed_page":11}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"},{"id":"manohara-s007-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s007","scene_ordinal":7,"transition_audit_id":"T007","speaker_label":"பத்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"செல்வா... கேட்டுக்கொண்டுதான் வந்தேன்! ராஜப்பிரியன் கூட சீறி விழுந்தானே, ஏன்? மந்திரியாரே... மனோகரன் கட்டாயம் நாடகத்துக்கு வருவான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":13,"printed_page":12}],"source_scene_file":"scene-007.md"}]}
